<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said. Carcass basis - A lower undertone noted on steers in a light test. Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs 110.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thurs: 300  Week to Date: 16,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
